{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>Now it shall devour them</b> — these children, along with their portion, [in] a month of calamity, as in: \"for the day of their calamity is near\" [Deuteronomy 32:35]. And R. Yeshuah says: a month of mourning. And Yefet says: for חֹדֶשׁ means girded with a sword, as in: \"and he was girded with a new [sword].\""], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:15.824513330Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}